{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"appraisal","key":"D01","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"YES: Clearly defines a wireless ad hoc UAV swarm over a 2D grid performing per-layer distributed CNN image classification to minimize transmit power and end-to-end latency under reliability and resource constraints.","evidence":[{"page":2,"section":"II. SYSTEM MODEL","quote":"we assume that a group of UAVs,"},{"page":3,"section":"III. PROBLEM FORMULATION","quote":"We formulate this scenario into three sub-problems;"}],"note":"Verified identically in arXiv and IEEE publisher PDF."}
{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"appraisal","key":"D02","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: States LoS-only channel (ignoring NLoS), equal-altitude 2D coordinates, collision distance, power/memory/compute bounds; omits interference in Eq. 5, flight/compute energy, and decentralized state-collection assumptions.","evidence":[{"page":3,"section":"II.B. Minimum Achievable Data Rate for Reliable Transmission","quote":"meets the Line of Sight (LoS) model"},{"page":4,"section":"III.B. UAVs Positions Optimization","quote":"to avoid collisions between UAVs and make sure"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"appraisal","key":"D03","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: Reports 480m×480m area (144 cells, R=20m), LeNet/AlexNet, three Raspberry Pi B+ ei rates (560, 512, 256), σ2=-170 dBm, h0=10^-5, Pmax=120 mW, τ=10^-4, 10/20 MHz; omits solver software, U/RQ sweeps, layer tables, and heuristic path spec.","evidence":[{"page":5,"section":"IV. SIMULATION RESULTS AND ANALYSIS","quote":"We adopted an area of 480m × 480m"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"appraisal","key":"D04","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: Compares LLHR against two internal baselines (static-path heuristic and random-move baseline) across varying request counts in Fig. 5; omits external SOTA comparators and exact request/UAV test conditions.","evidence":[{"page":6,"section":"IV. SIMULATION RESULTS AND ANALYSIS","quote":"Figure 5 compares our LLHR approach with two"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"appraisal","key":"D05","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: Optimization minimizes transmit power (P1/P2) and classification latency (P3) under a rate-derived reliability threshold; Figs. 2–5 plot average latency and minimum power, but actual packet reliability and classification accuracy are never measured.","evidence":[{"page":5,"section":"IV. SIMULATION RESULTS AND ANALYSIS","quote":"Figure 4 shows the results of average minimum"},{"page":6,"section":"IV. SIMULATION RESULTS AND ANALYSIS","quote":"Average Latency for Different Requests in Different Models."}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"appraisal","key":"D06","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"NO: Reports no trial counts, random seeds, dispersion/error bars, or statistical tests; only parametric sweeps over Pmax, UAV count, bandwidth, memory, and request count in Figs. 2–5.","evidence":[{"page":5,"section":"IV. SIMULATION RESULTS AND ANALYSIS","quote":"Figure 2 shows the results of latency in"},{"page":6,"section":"IV. SIMULATION RESULTS AND ANALYSIS","quote":"as we vary the number of requests."}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"appraisal","key":"D07","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: Models 2D grid coordinates, Euclidean path loss (Eq. 4), and collision distance (Eq. 8d), but ignores NLoS, fading, interference in Eq. 5, 3D altitude, MAC contention, and UAV/link failures.","evidence":[{"page":3,"section":"II.B. Minimum Achievable Data Rate for Reliable Transmission","quote":"and ignore the Non LoS (NLoS) in"},{"page":6,"section":"V. CONCLUSION","quote":"under different modes like a line of sight"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"appraisal","key":"D08","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: Claims optimal trajectory planning and interference mitigation in §V, whereas evaluation solves periodic 2D static positions under LoS-only simulation without an interference term in Eq. 5 or hardware validation.","evidence":[{"page":6,"section":"V. CONCLUSION","quote":"finding the best UAV path to mitigate interference."}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"appraisal","key":"D09","status":"NOT_REPORTED","finding":"NOT_REPORTED: Checked §§I–V, Acknowledgment, and References (pp. 1–6) in both arXiv and IEEE publisher PDF; no author code, simulation scripts, or dataset links are provided.","evidence":[{"page":6,"section":"ACKNOWLEDGMENT (IEEE publisher PDF)","quote":"This work was made possible by NPRP grant"}],"note":"Checked pp. 1–6 in both arXiv and IEEE publisher PDF; no artifact URL found."}
