{"id":"HKF-115","kind":"technical","key":"t2_partition","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"Per-layer CNN partitioning across L sequential layers with binary assignment δr,i,j ∈ {0,1} assigning each layer j of request r to exactly one UAV i (Eqs. 10, 11c–11d); each UAV stores a copy of the trained CNN.","evidence":[{"page":3,"section":"II.A. CNN Network Configuration","quote":"Each UAV has a copy of the trained"},{"page":4,"section":"III.C. Layers Allocations Optimization","quote":"We emphasize that we adopted the method of"}],"note":""}
