{"id":"HKF-062","kind":"appraisal","key":"D01","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"YES: Clearly defines simultaneous multi-DNN distributed inference across heterogeneous UAVs (center, requesting, worker) using containerized partitions to minimize weighted e2e latency and normalized per-device energy.","evidence":[{"page":2,"section":"1. Introduction","quote":"simultaneously deployed and heterogeneous task models [6,21] in"},{"page":3,"section":"3.1.2. Deployment process","quote":"Swarm Manager is deployed in the center UAV"}],"note":""}
