{"id":"HKF-062","kind":"appraisal","key":"D08","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: Conclusions align with simulated latency/energy/longevity gains, but describe a realistic UAV environment without hardware testbed, real inference accuracy, or security/initialization validation.","evidence":[{"page":8,"section":"5. Conclusion","quote":"In this work, we discussed a realistic UAV"},{"page":9,"section":"5. Conclusion","quote":"The proposed method achieved the best energy efficiency"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-062","kind":"appraisal","key":"D09","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"NO: Data availability explicitly states no data was used; a Python implementation is mentioned in §3.6, but no public code repository or supplementary artifact link is provided.","evidence":[{"page":6,"section":"3.6. Partition deployment algorithm","quote":"the wall-clock time of the python implementation of"},{"page":9,"section":"Data availability","quote":"No data was used for the research described"}],"note":""}
