{"id":"HKF-051","kind":"appraisal","key":"D01","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"YES: Clearly defines a hybrid drone-edge early-exit and task-offloading framework (local exit, local+offload, direct offload) with bottleneck DNN and edge load balancing to maximize latency-constrained system inference accuracy.","evidence":[{"page":1,"section":"Abstract","quote":"Considering image processing in UAV applications, we propose"},{"page":4,"section":"3.1. Fast inference with drone-edge cooperation","quote":"The edge servers assign the successfully uploaded data"}],"note":""}
